<title>USA: Young Minds IPO moved to early next year.</title>
<headline>Young Minds IPO moved to early next year.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The planned initial public offering of the Redlands, California software company Young Minds Inc, which was scheduled for this week, has been moved to early next year, according to lead underwriter Sharpe Capital Inc.</p>
<p>Young Minds Inc planned to offer 1.15 million shares in a range of $11 to $13 each.</p>
</text>
